  unitName: Dual Blade Eru
  unitId: 60293
  unitNumber: 653
  description: A soldier who led the civilians from the Bariura Empire during the
    last stages of the war with the gods in hopes of finding a new land. Known by
    everyone in the Bariura Empire, he sought to implement the same migratory movement
    of the neighboring countries within the empire. However, the nobility of the
    empire dismissed his idea, and branding him a coward, stripped him of his knighthood.
    Disappointed in his motherland, he led only a part of the empire in search of
    a new land with his beloved twin blades in hand.
  summonDesc: Are you the one<br>who will bring peace to the people?<br>If so, I'll
    devote my dual blades to you!
  fusionDesc: You're gonna make me stronger?<br>If it's for my people,<br>I'll gladly
    accept.
